blication metrics were produced.\n\nRelevant logs:\n- `human-intervention-logs/com.google.oauth-client:google-oauth-client:1.35.0/scaffold/scaffold-2026-10-13T11-17-51-537133Z.log`\n- `human-intervention-logs/com.google.oauth-client:google-oauth-client:1.35.0/discover-artifact-metadata/discover_artifact_metadata.log`\n- `human-intervention-logs/com.google.oauth-client:google-oauth-client:1.35.0/library-preparation-preflight/claude-code.log`\n\nManual next steps:\n1. Retry scaffolding in an environment with working DNS and Maven repository access, confirming the `1.35.0` POM and JAR resolve.\n2. Generate tests using `MockHttpTransport` and `MockLowLevelHttpResponse` to exercise OAuth token flows without external network access.\n3. Run the coordinate-scoped JVM/native tests and dynamic-access reporting, then generate and validate the missing metadata and metrics.", "textSignature": "{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0fb330794fc073b2016ace23bf817087d198727a490483d141\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}], "api": "openai-codex-responses", "provider": "openai-codex", "model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "usage": {"input": 12337, "output": 904, "cacheRead": 55936, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 516, "totalTokens": 69177, "cost": {"input": 0, "output": 0, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0}}, "stopReason": "stop", "timestamp": 1791894441758, "responseId": "resp_0fb330794fc073b2016ace23b1030887d1b920672e84de50dc", "rawStopReason": "completed"}, "toolResults": []}
